{"type":"text","timestamp":1784778441693,"sessionID":"ses_072eb30ddffeaP1O41m3i47bO4","part":{"id":"prt_f8d15b04e001mAC6osVHGTEiBW","messageID":"msg_f8d159887001qO60ohjgkXVt8a","sessionID":"ses_072eb30ddffeaP1O41m3i47bO4","type":"text","text":"**查询结果：**\n\n| 指标 | 数值 |\n|------|------|\n| 男性住院病人 (Male In-patient, Admission='+') | 89 |\n| 男性门诊病人 (Male Outpatient, Admission='-') | 107 |\n| 百分比 (In-patient / Outpatient × 100) | 83.18% |\n\n**结论：** 门诊病人中男性更多（107 vs 89）。男性住院病人数量相当于男性门诊病人的 **83.18%**。\n\n---\n\n```\nFinal Answer: Outpatient males are more (107) than in-patient males (89); the percentage (in-patient/outpatient) is 83.18%\nEvidence SQL: SELECT COUNT(CASE WHEN SEX = 'M' AND Admission = '+' THEN ID END) AS male_inpatient, COUNT(CASE WHEN SEX = 'M' AND Admission = '-' THEN ID END) AS male_outpatient, ROUND(100.0 * COUNT(CASE WHEN SEX = 'M' AND Admission = '+' THEN ID END) / NULLIF(COUNT(CASE WHEN SEX = 'M' AND Admission = '-' THEN ID END), 0), 2) AS percentage FROM Patient\n```","time":{"start":1784778436687,"end":1784778441684}}}
